  - id: memory-returns
    title: The Memory Returns
    start: 170
    end: 176
    direction: The heritage scene fades. The crystal settles onto its museum podium
      as the room's outlines reappear.
    voiceOverEn: 'We return with that promise: rooted in heritage, ready for tomorrow.'
    voiceOverAr: "\u0646\u0639\u0648\u062F \u0628\u0647\u0630\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0648\u0639\u062F:
      \u062C\u0630\u0648\u0631\u064C \u0631\u0627\u0633\u062E\u0629 \u0641\u064A
